%N A283162 Number of free polyominoes with n cells containing a complete self-avoiding walk obeying mortal coil rules.
%C A283162 A walk obeying mortal coil rules is a walk that can turn only when it can no longer move in the same direction (reached a dead end).
%H A283162 Carlo Corti, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23914650">Enumerating Coil-Coverable Free Polyominoes through 24 Cells</a>, Zenodo, 2026.
